note Pyamff 240f51d0 (2026-07-04), unmodified. Same C2H4 problem, 50 random_uniform starts, and convergence as the archive: hidden layers 10 7, tanh, NoScaler, one batch, torch LBFGS learning rate 0.01, force coefficient 0.1, epochs_max 30000, maximum absolute loss gradient on each parameter set below 0.10. One batch makes that per-parameter test the full loss gradient, the same stop as the ADAM row on this commit. The release removed the SE loss, so the run uses SSE. init_model_parameters is true so a fresh model is created. A start fails when the log reports Max Epoch. One harness force call is one logged epoch.
